# 41. Critical Requirement — Do Not Fake Agent Activity

Do NOT create fake progress bars or fake logs.

If the dashboard says:

```text
Backend Agent
Working
78%
```

that information must come from actual agent execution.

Likewise:

```text
Tests passed
Files changed
Commits
Token usage
Execution time
```

must come from real execution data.

The demo mode may use simulated agents, but production mode must use actual agent runs.

